31,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Good morning. Asuka, you were very analytical yesterday. Do you have any leads?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope we don't execute an innocent person.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I have a very clear lead. Ryuji is the werewolf.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"That's a bold claim to make so early. Do you have proof, or are you the Seer?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh! Asuka, are you saying you're the Seer? That's a big revelation.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"If Asuka is the Seer, the game could end today. But we have to be sure she isn't the werewolf lying.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,@Asuka... are you really the Seer?,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I am. I divined Ryuji last night, and the result was werewolf. There is no reason for me to lie.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,It's a classic play. The werewolf claims to be the Seer to frame a villager. I am human.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,It's hard to know who to believe. But Asuka seemed so confident.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, if you're human, how do you explain Asuka's direct accusation?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't know. I'm scared of making the wrong choice.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Ryuji's response is typical. He's trying to cast doubt on the Seer's identity to survive.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am simply pointing out the possibility of a bluff. Logic dictates we consider all options.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,I feel like Asuka is being honest. Her tone hasn't changed.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm inclined to trust Asuka. The risk of keeping a confirmed werewolf is too high.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,If everyone else agrees... I'll go with that.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,The evidence is clear. Vote for Ryuji.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,This is a mistake. You are falling for a deception.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I'm sorry, Ryuji, but I believe Asuka.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
